Description:
Trades added:
<br />Clay for 10 stone from the moment shop is unlocked;
<br />Moss for 10 fiber after 2 requests;
<br />Acorn for 40 wood after 4 requests;
<br />Pine Cone for 20 fiber after 4 requests;
<br />Maple Seed for 30 stone after 4 requests;
<br />Mixed Flower Seeds for Mixed Seeds after 4 requests;
<br />Magic Rock Candy for 5 prismatic shards after 6 requests.
<br />
<br />Trades changed:
<br />Carrot Seeds, Summer Squash Seeds, Broccoli Seeds and Powdermelon Seeds now only take 10 sap when trading.
<br />
<br />All trades are unlimited
<br />
<br />To get this mod to work install SMAPI and Content Patcher and unzip it into your mods folder
